## Obtaining GFM data likely to contain flood observations

To obtain GFM data using this repository you need to: 
0. Create a [virtual environment](#environment-setup)
1. Load AWS credentials into ~/.aws/credentials or your bash environment for the s3 bucket you want to upload data to.
2. Construct a valid [configuration file](#config-file). Instructions for doing this are below.

